            "review_title": "Review at Letefe Bistro & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Pinosuarez\nTaos, NM10 contributions\n0\nConsistency\nJan 2021\nThis a diner type restaurant. Variety of Vietnamese and western comfort foods. Everything on the menu is good. You can always expect that the food will be cooked well and taste good. I have never had a bad meal here. They don’t seem to have bad days. Great prices. Wonderful staff. After two visits they remember you and you feel like a regular. When I just want a good plate of food that tastes good with no drama, I know I can come here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 15, 2021",
