            "review_title": "Review at Letefe Bistro & Cafe",
            "review_text": "tumbleweeds023\nHanoi, Vietnam580 contributions\n0\nGreat menu, prices and service\nNov 2020\nThis comfortable and trendy restaurant serves a great variety of food, from delicious salads to hot pot, steak, pasta, stew, pandan chicken... a little bit of everything, and they make all of it perfectly. Whatever your nationality, you'll find something exciting to order - I'm not surprised that it's popular with the locals, too. \n\nStaff remembers you when you return, and the service is always excellent. Usually, you'll get a little freebie when you come, too - some spring rolls, or a beverage, maybe a dessert on the house - something different each time. \n\nPrices are more than reasonable for a place of this quality. I've been coming here regularly since they opened earlier this year and I've never been disappointed. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 14, 2020",
